#: account/forms/account_setup.py
msgid ""
"I declare that OpenKAT may scan the assets of my organization and that I "
"have permission to scan these assets. I am aware of the implications a scan "
"(with a higher scan level) brings on my systems."
msgstr ""
"Ik ferklearje dat OpenKAT de assets fan myn organisaasje scanne mei en dat "
"ik tastimming haw om dizze assets te scannen. Ik bin my bewust fan de "
"gefolgen dy’t in scan (mei in heger scannivo) hat op myn systemen."

#: account/forms/account_setup.py
msgid ""
"I declare that I am authorized to give this indemnification on behalf of my "
"organization. I have the experience and knowledge to know what the "
"consequences might be and can be held responsible for them."
msgstr ""
"Ik ferklearje dat ik foech haw om dizze frijwarring binnen myn organisaasje "
"ôf te jaan. Ik haw de ûnderfining en de kennis om te witten wat de gefolgen "
"wêze kinne en kin dêrfoar ferantwurdlik hâlden wurde."

